SUMMARY:WUNC Spotlight: Who's in Hot Water? An Interactive Spotlight with Celeste Guajardo
DESCRIPTION:Join WUNC Environment reporter Celeste Guajardo for an interactive Spotlight event exploring North Carolina water policy through a live\, game-show-style experience. Featuring storytelling\, audience participation\, and field reporting clips\, the event will break down PFAS and 1\,4-dioxane pollution\, the politics behind water regulation\, and the public health impacts shaping the state’s water future. Includes a live Q&A and complimentary lunch. Space is limited. \nThis event is part of WUNC’s 50th anniversary celebration\, featuring 50 events across North Carolina that bring people together through community\, conversation\, and storytelling.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/wunc-spotlight-whos-in-hot-water-an-interactive-spotlight-with-celeste-guajardo/
LOCATION:WUNC Public Radio Suite 600\, 324 Blackwell st. Suite 600\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Community Engagement,Free,Game Night,Science & Technology
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/POSTCA1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="WUNC Public Radio":MAILTO:events@wunc.org
GEO:35.993377;-78.9051601
