SUMMARY:Downtown Durham Historian-Guided Tour
DESCRIPTION:Experience the history of downtown Durham\, strolling between the city’s historic sites. Learn of Durham’s pivotal role in the industrialization of the American South\, how a Durham banking magnate transformed the lives of millions of rural farmers\, the tobacco factories that powered the city’s future\, and much more.
